{command} <subcommand>
AI admin settings: toggle the AI, switch models, manage per-user history limits and check the Groq quota.
*/ aiset on|off [global]  - turn the AI on or off (in this room, or globally)
*/ aiset model [1-7]      - switch to another Groq model
*/ aiset ulimit <jid> <n> - set a per-user history limit (also: aiset ulimit list, aiset ulimit <jid> reset)
*/ aiset reset all        - wipe every user's AI history
*/ aiset history <sub>    - save|load|info|clear the AI history and room logs
*/ aiset quota            - show the Groq API quota (requests, tokens, reset times)
*/ aiset ping             - test the connection to Groq
*/ aiset reloadkey        - reload the Groq API key from the key file
*/ aiset info             - full AI status (provider, model, users, messages)
Needs access level 1 for the basics and 3 for the admin-only subcommands.
On and off also accept 'global' to apply the change to every room.
